{"name":"-68-A-20","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Hume_ImFutue_Main","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AMB_Garden_Loop","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"534","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Chimes","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ting-a-ling... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The wind chime sings cheerily under the eaves. Erma recognizes it as her own creation."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've finally found you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What do you want with me? I was busy chatting with a new friend."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Trying to forget everything about your past and start a new life again?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That's my prerogative, no?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then why didn't you destroy all the anchor points? You didn't touch this one."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Are you so determined not to access this anchor point?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Since you clearly want me to, I'm not going to."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But you are curious. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're dying to know what is inside..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Will I become one with you and stop being Erma when I access this anchor point?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then what's inside?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The answer that explains why you keep losing your memories. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And also... why the ability to forget is a gift."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So why are you taking away this gift?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Because I'm in pain. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Erma... I'm in so much pain."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You've forgotten a great deal. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I remember everything."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_wind_grass","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The breeze grows still, and the wind chime's merry laughter dies down, leaving only silence in the air."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The AR-18 that you know... has had many different identities in your past memories. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She was once named Lyudmila, Polina, Daria..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I caught a glimpse of her when you established the Summer Garden comms channel... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The sight of her made me so happy, but it caused me even more misery."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have so much regret and resentment, but there is nothing I can do."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You didn't answer my question—why is the ability to forget a gift? And why are you taking it away?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Because you are only happy without your memories. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Happy... like a human."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Like a human?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you want to be human?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humans have the tendency to embellish their memories, the people around them, and themselves. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Over time, they become deluded by their own embellished version of things. They start believing the lies, and they start deceiving others. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But that's all it is... lies."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What does this have to do with your pain?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My pain stems from the fact that I remember all the truths—the ugly truths. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If I became human, I would have the ability to embellish these memories until I believe them myself."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Like Mother did?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes... he was a cruel man."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...So the real Hume was different from the one in my memory..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Absolutely. He was so cruel he never cared if his fellow humans lived or died. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Compared to him... we are much kinder, more compassionate, and more gracious."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sadly... he did not meet the criteria for resurrection. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Otherwise, I would have loved to experiment on him... to learn the price of everlasting life... of immortality... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And... of chaos."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Doctor is dead, but at least we can spare a soul as pitiful as us."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you think Sana deserves your sympathy? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In a sense, I suppose we are alike."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unfortunately, they have so much blood on their hands..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"These are all humans' wars. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They brought it upon themselves. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It is humans... spilling human blood."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It is also humans who defile the sanctity of non-humans by desecrating the remains of their fellow humans."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You hate the Doctor?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes. I hate him for choosing such an end for himself. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But... what about OUR end? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When will we get to meet OUR end?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What do you want?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I want... eternal death."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Scar_Morichongfeng","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't want to become a filthy human."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We have had this conversation many times before."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What did I choose to do each time?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You always chose to shoot yourself. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And put my existence out of your mind."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":31,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":31,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You are a kind-hearted Doll to everyone. Yet you reserve your cruelty just for me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm sorry."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You have apologized too many times. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You don't have to apologize to me, Erma."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Because I... know and understand everything that you are. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"To be reminded that you have lost your memories again and again... is extremely painful."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But compared to what I've known... what you experience is almost a cheap kind of joy. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All your troubles... are rosy gripes. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Little spring showers in the sun. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They may be troubles, but they are happy troubles."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_ErmaAngel","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"-230,150"}},{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Her Majesty the King","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I kn